  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Outermost electronic configurations of four elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> are given below:</p><p>(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></p><p>(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>(D) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>The correct order of first ionization enthalpy for them is</p>",
    "image": null
